title: Campaigning
new-page: true
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; campaigning_timer = 1
max-visits: 36
is-card: true
frequency: 143
tags: party_affairs
view-if: CHP_party_leader == "İnönü" and campaigning_timer <= 0
card-image: img/inonu_campaigning.jpeg
go-to: memorandum_blocked if rubicon_mode and not (rubicon_melen_join and CHP_in_government and prime_minister = "Ferit Melen")

= Campaigning

Whether or not we are in an electoral campaign, the party is always trying to broaden its voter base. Who should we focus our campaign efforts on?

- @workers: The rising urban working class has been attracted by our recent shift in policy.
- @petty_bourgeoisie: The middle class, including artisans and shopkeepers, is typically affiliated with liberal parties.
- @state_employees: Citizens employed by the state and the bureaucracy.
- @rural: Rural workers and small farmers have previously felt neglected by our party.
- @capitalists: Perhaps we should consider strategies to maintain our weakening ties with industrialists and landlords.
- @root: We either don't want to or cannot campaign right now.
- @easy_discard

@workers
subtitle: -1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} workers_chp += 4.5*(1-dissent); resources -= 1;

We have intensified our campaigning among the workers, who do not express enthusiasm for the continuation of the status quo and are attracted by our promises.

@petty_bourgeoisie
subtitle: -1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} petty_bourgeoisie_chp += 4.5*(1-dissent); resources -= 1; {! if(Q.cyprus_problem===3)AnatolianNationalCoalition.awardCyprusDemographics(Q,"petty-campaign",7.5,["petty_bourgeoisie"]); !}

We have intensified our campaigning among the small business owners. [? if socialism <= 49 and peoples_party == 0: However, the high levels of conservatism within this group present significant challenges to our efforts. ?] [? if peoples_party > 0: As a people's party, we have an easier time increasing support among the middle class than before. ?]

@state_employees
subtitle: -1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} state_employees_chp += 7.5*(1-dissent); resources -= 1

We have intensified our campaigning among the bureaucracy. The state and bureaucracy workers have traditionally voted for us or CGP. [? if nationalism >= 51 and peoples_party == 0: The high levels of nationalism among this group make our campaign more difficult. ?] [? if peoples_party > 0: As a people's party, we have an easier time increasing support among the middle class than before. ?]

@rural
subtitle: -1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} rural_chp += 1.0499999999999998*(1-dissent); resources -= 1; rural_chp += 2.25*(1-dissent) if rural_policy >= 2; rural_chp += 3.0*(1-dissent) if rural_land_reform_policy >= 1; rural_chp += 3.0*(1-dissent) if land_reform == 1; rural_chp += 4.5*(1-dissent) if land_reform == 2; rural_chp += 4.5*(1-dissent) if land_reform == 3

We have intensified our campaigning among farmers. Historically, we have not focused our efforts on this group, resulting in a lack of trust[? if land_reform == 3 : ; however, the implementation of the Köykent project has significantly improved our support in rural areas ?]. [? if peoples_party > 0: As a people's party, we have an easier time increasing support among farmers than before. ?] [? if rural_policy >= 2 : Our rural policies have made it easier for us to build support among farmers. ?] [? if rural_land_reform_policy >= 1 : Our land reform policies give us additional credibility with rural voters. ?] [? if land_reform == 1 : Our agricultural cooperatives law has improved our standing with farmers. ?] [? if land_reform == 2 : Our land distribution law has significantly boosted our rural appeal. ?]

@capitalists
subtitle: -1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commitAdvisor(Q); !} left_kemalists_dissent += 5; kemalist_marxists_dissent += 10; capitalists_chp += 4.5; resources -= 1

We reaffirm our commitment to corporatism and the market economy, for what it's worth. The Marxist and Left-Wing Kemalist factions strongly disapprove of this action.

@root

We either don't want to or cannot campaign right now.
